    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17334" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐδάζομαι</span></b> , Dep., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐδή</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cry out, speak,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐδάξασθαι φωνῇ ἀνθρωπηίῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.55
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				48
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτ᾽ ἔπος ηὐδάσατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Aet.</u>
					3.1.21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>name,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.127
			</span></i>:—
				Act.
			, fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐδάξω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					892
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ηὔδαξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					360
				</span></i>
			, dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.218
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Alc.
			</span></i>):—
				Pass.
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐδαχθεῖσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>H.</u>
					27.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
